P: There were 84,817 MOT tests of the Fiat Panda in 2025. 35.9% failed first time, against 27.7% for all cars. Older cars fail more often, so the fairer comparison is by age:
H3: What they failed on
LI: Suspension : 17.0% of tests (all cars 9.0%). Shock absorber prices
LI: Lamps, reflectors and electrical equipment : 12.3% of tests (all cars 10.6%). Headlight bulb prices by type
LI: Brakes : 8.1% of tests (all cars 6.2%). Brake pad prices , brake disc prices
LI: Tyres : 6.7% of tests (all cars 6.2%)
LI: Visibility : 5.8% of tests (all cars 4.3%). Wiper blade prices
