H2: Known Faults - Fiat Doblo
P: The notes below come from the RAC, Parkers and Carbuyer.
H3: Dualogic Semi-Automatic Gearbox
P: CHECK ú 2015-2019 ú Get a quote
P: The RAC's 2015-2019 Doblo review tells buyers to be suspicious of cars fitted with Fiat's Dualogic semi-automatic transmission, a set-up it says has often proved to be less than reliable.
H3: Manual Gearbox and Clutch
P: MONITOR ú 2010-2022 ú Get a quote
P: In its 2015-2019 Doblo review and its 2010-2022 Cargo van review, the RAC reports lots of complaints about the gearbox and advises checking it on your drive. For the 2010-2014 car it also lists slipping clutches on the manual cars as a point to check.
H3: Headlamps
P: MINOR ú 2015-2019 ú Get a quote
P: The RAC says the headlamps on the 2015-2019 Doblo fail rather often.
H3: Heating From Cold
P: MINOR ú 2015-2019 ú Get a quote
P: In its 2015-2019 review the RAC says one owner pointed out that the heating does not always work from cold.
H3: Wipers and Door Handles
P: MINOR ú 2001-2022 ú Get a quote
P: One Parkers owner of a 2001-2010 Doblo with the MultiJet diesel says the windscreen wiper motors can be fragile, and that the sliding door handles must not be forced in frosty weather or they can break. Parkers also says wiper issues are not uncommon on the Cargo van.
H3: Rear Central Locking
P: MINOR ú 2010-2022 ú Get a quote
P: Parkers says a plastic part in the rear central-locking mechanism can fail on the Cargo van.
H3: Electrics and Earthing
P: MONITOR ú 2010-2022 ú Get a quote
P: Parkers says there have been reports of electric issues on the Cargo van, typically related to minor earthing faults that are easily resolved. The RAC tells buyers of the 2010-2014 car to make sure all the electrical functions work as advertised, as these can be expensive to fix. One Carbuyer owner describes continual electric problems associated with the computer.
H3: MultiJet Diesel Particulate Filter
P: MONITOR ú 2001-2010 ú Get a quote
P: A Parkers owner of a 2001-2010 Doblo says the 1.3-litre MultiJet eventually started to suffer a blocked DPF, with associated warning lights.
H3: Engine Noise, Smoke and Overheating
P: CHECK ú 2010-2022 ú Get a quote
P: For the 2010-2022 Cargo van the RAC says to look out for slow starting, tapping from the engine bay and dark smoke from the exhaust. It also reports that one owner had a bumping sound from the rear, while another experienced sudden overheating.
H3: Rear Bumpstops and Suspension Bushes
P: MINOR ú 2010-2022 ú Get a quote
P: Parkers says the Doblo works its rear bumpstops rather hard, and if they are worn out or missing it will become loud over bumps and potentially develop some handling issues. One Carbuyer owner says the suspension bushes had to be replaced twice.
H3: Braking
P: CHECK ú 2010-2021 ú Get a quote
P: One Carbuyer owner, in reviews covering 2010-2021, reports lots of problems with braking, and lots of gearbox problems too.
H3: Safety Recalls
P: CHECK ú Any age ú Ask a Fiat dealer
P: DVSA's recall data lists several Doblo recalls, including these.
LI: Affected vehicles may have a tyre load index on the vehicle that is lower than the declared rear axle capacity.
LI: On affected vehicles diesel fuel leaks may possibly occur due to the vehicle being fitted with a fuel return pipe without protective tape.
LI: The brake vacuum pump may not function correctly.
LI: The lower fastening brackets which secure the body to the chassis are not manufactured to specification.
LI: On vehicles fitted with comfort instrument panel when the passenger's airbag has been deactivated it is possible in some cases that it will reactivate spontaneously.
LI: It has been established that the anti-roll bar may not conform to specification.
P: To see where a particular vehicle stands, enter its registration in our recall check .
H2: Buying a used Fiat Doblo
P: The RAC says the 2010-2014 Doblo has a decent reliability record, and Parkers says the 2001-2010 car has fared well.
P: At a viewing, ask about the gearbox and clutch, test the lights, wipers and heater, and try every door lock. Finish by running the registration through our recall check, and get insurance quotes by registration for the vehicle.
H2: Breakdown cover
P: If a fault stops the car on the road, breakdown cover sends help to you. Compare two UK providers and check what each policy includes.
P: We earn a commission if you buy cover through these links, at no cost to you ( how we're paid ).
