P: There were 43,018 MOT tests of the Fiat Doblo in 2025. 36.9% failed first time, against 27.7% for all cars. Older cars fail more often, so the fairer comparison is by age:
H3: What they failed on
LI: Suspension : 16.9% of tests (all cars 9.0%). Shock absorber prices
LI: Lamps, reflectors and electrical equipment : 15.1% of tests (all cars 10.6%). Headlight bulb prices by type
LI: Tyres : 7.7% of tests (all cars 6.2%)
LI: Noise, emissions and leaks : 7.4% of tests
